{
  "id": "1CH.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Amakuru 19",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyabaire byahingwire, Nahashi omukama w'Abaamoni atahya; omutabani amusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agamba ati, “Hanuni eya Nahashi ndamukolerage, kuba ishe nawe akankorage.” Aho atuma entumwa kumushura n'orufu rwa ishe, atweka abaramatabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abarangira b'Abaamoni bagambira Hanuni bati, “Nolenga oti Daudi atwekire ab'okukutekesa orufu okuba nakunira sho? Abaramatabe baizire kurambura ensi n'okuginyomoza kwija kugitera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Hanuni akwata abaramata ba Daudi abamoisa ebileju, ebijwaro byabo abishalira omugati omu nyugunyu, ababinga bagenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Bagambiire Daudi amakuru g'abaramata abo, atuma ab'okugya kubachwekera, kuba enshoni zikaba zibali kubi muno. Omukama agamba ati, “Mwikare Yeriko kuhika orwo ebileju byanyu biramera, aho mugaruke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaamoni kabaaboine okwo benobesize Daudi, Hanuni n'Abaamoni batweka ekilo 34,000 z'efeza kukodi amagali n'ab'efarasi kuruga Mesopotamia, Arammaaka na Zoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakodi amagali 32,000, bataho n'omukama wa Maaka n'eihelye, baija basisira balebire Medeba. Abaamoni baruga omu bigo byabo, bahurura kurashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi kukihulira atweka Yoabu n'eihe lyona ely'abaisherukare emanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaamoni bashohora bemelera omu maisho g'ekigo kurashana, n'abakama ababaire baizire baikara bonkai omu karungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu kubona endashana okwo yamwema obuso n'enyuma, arondamu abaisherukare emanzi z'amani omuli Isiraeli abateka kurashanisa Abasiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisherukare abasigaire abakwasa Abishai, omurumuna, nabo batekwa kurashanisa Abaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agamba ati, “K'Abasiria baranshaga amani aho iwe onjune; kyonkai k'Abaamoni barakushaga amani, aho inye ndakujuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obe manzi, tukwate mashaija, turashanire eihanga lyaitu n'ebigo bya Ruhanga waitu. Omukama asinge akore okwo arayenda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoabu n'abantu abo yabaire ainabo bailira haihi omu maisho g'Abasiria kurwana endashana, kyonkai bonene bamwiruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaamoni kabaaboine okwo Abasiria basingwa, nabo kutyo Abishai murumuna Yoabu bamwiruka, bataha omu kigo. Aho Yoabu aija Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai orwo Abasiria baboine okwo basingwa Isiraeli, batuma entumwa kuleta Abasiria ababaire bali buseli bwa Efurati, baija na Shofaki, omukuru w'eihe lya Hadadezeri, abebembeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababigambiire Daudi, yahuruza Isiraeli yona, bashabuka Yordani, babagoba, ateka abaisherukare kubarashanisa. Abasiria barashana nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasiria bairuka AbaIsiraeli, kyonkai Daudi abaita, abaisherukare 7,000 ab'amagali, abaisherukare ab'amaguru 40,000; aita na Shofaki omukuru w'eihe lyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abairu ba Hadadezeri baboine basingwa Isiraeli, bayehongera Daudi, yabatwara. Kwema aho Abasiria tibakunzire kujuna Baamoni rundi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
